   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rural Develoment in MAC has been supported since 199l. Support through ALKA, working in 34 municipalities, is now granted for a last and final phase, where Alka will work in 9 new municipalities. Infra strucutre etc with support from the municipalities and high  participation from citizens.</narrative>
